      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p><tei:hi rend="bold">DOWNLOAD:</tei:hi> PDF</tei:p>
        <tei:p>This short piyut touches on these four themes related to Shmitah: release of debts, the rights of the land, the rights of wild animals (who share our food during Shmitah), and the freeing of slaves. The piyut would fit as part of Seliḥot before Rosh haShanah and during Yom Kippur...(With thanks to Itsik Pariente for help with grammar.)</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_38810_introduction"/>
